  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Screening and identification of options for Danish support to reduce loss and damage from climate-induced impacts</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding for climate disaster response and reconstruction is still mainly arranged ex-post, increasing the cost of disasters and their impacts on lives and livelihoods. There is therefore a need to increase support to addressing and loss and damage from climate-induced impacts including support to multi-lateral initiative for pre-arranged financial support designed to be quickly deployed in times of climate disasters.</narrative>
  </description>
